{
  "title": "Quick Salty Greek Tomatoes Horiatiki Salad",
  "description": "A salty and crumbly post-workout Greek dish featuring chopped tomatoes and lardons, served in a horiatiki style.",
  "cuisine": "Greek",
  "diet": [
    "kosher"
