      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "pitted"
    },
    {
      "name": "extra virgin olive oil",
      "amount": "2 tablespoons"
    },
    {
      "name": "salt",
      "amount": "1 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "pepper",
      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Render the lardons in a Dutch oven over medium heat until crispy.",
    "Add the chopped tomatoes to the Dutch oven and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the sliced red onion to the Dutch oven and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the crumbly feta cheese, pitted kalamata olives, olive oil, salt, and pepper.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a serving bowl.",
    "Serve the salad hot, garnished with additional olives and feta cheese if desired.",
    "Let the salad cool to room temperature before refrigerating.",
    "Refrigerate the salad for at least 30 minutes before serving."
  ],
